{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionArithmeticCore","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionArithmeticCore","imports":["lean:module:Init"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.mod_two_counterexample","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.mod_two_counterexample","kind":"theorem","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/ObstructionArithmeticCore.lean#L43-L46","doc":"The argument genuinely needs `gcd(2, 3) = 1`: mod **2** the same statement is **false**,\nwitnessed by `1 = -1`.  So this is not a general fact about torsion — it is specific to the\ncentre of `SL(3)` being `μ₃` of odd order. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.ne_neg_of_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.ne_neg_of_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/ObstructionArithmeticCore.lean#L39-L41","doc":"Contrapositive — the statement a search actually applies: a **non-trivial** obstruction\nclass is not fixed by negation, hence its representations are not self-dual. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.eq_zero_of_eq_neg_mod_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.eq_zero_of_eq_neg_mod_three","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/ObstructionArithmeticCore.lean#L36-L37","doc":"The form the obstruction argument uses: a class fixed by negation is trivial. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.two_torsion_free_mod_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.two_torsion_free_mod_three","kind":"theorem","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/ObstructionArithmeticCore.lean#L33-L34","doc":"`x + x = 0` forces `x = 0` in `ℤ/3`: two is invertible mod three. ","signatureChunk":0}]}